    "updated_at": "2025-03-20T20:23:08Z",
    "body": "@shannonbooth I looked at patching the URL standard for the port case specifically, but it does raise the question what we want to do for inputs such as\n\n- `80/x`\n- `80?x`\n- `80†`\n\nShould those be errors or not? Depends? I guess I don't mind treating them all as errors if everyone is okay with that, but we should add more tests.\n\ncc @anonrig @sisidovski ",
