    "created_at": "2025-03-21T00:11:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-21T00:11:48Z",
    "body": "> As an idea of a potential fix, step 2.2 of port state parser in URL spec could be changed to return failure if code point is not EOF.\n\nSo the proposed plan is to make the basic url parser returns failure. So we also should update the test to expect  \"error\" right?",
